OL,3,GNEWSAIrish heritage and culture, as
OL,4,Atold by the women of the North West
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorth-west England has always had a
OL,7,Frich and deep connection to Irish
OL,8,Fheritage, with Manchester, Lancashire -
OL,9,Fand Liverpool in particular - famed for
OL,10,Fits historic Irish communities.
OL,12,FMany families settled in the region
OL,13,Fafter mass migration began from the
OL,14,Fmid-19th century during the Great
OL,15,FFamine.
