OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAIrish heritage and culture, as
OL,4,Atold by the women of the North West
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnd with the boom of heavy industry -
OL,7,Ffrom shipbuilding and canal and road
OL,8,Fbuilding in Liverpool to the mills of
OL,9,FManchester and Lancashire - by the 20th
OL,10,Fcentury, these areas became a heartland
OL,11,Fof Irish culture, including social
OL,12,Fclubs, folk music and the influence of
OL,13,Fthe Catholic church.
OL,15,FStill today the link persists, with the
OL,16,Fregion being the most popular choice
OL,17,Ffor Irish university students choosing
OL,18,Fto study overseas, according to the
OL,19,FDepartment for the Economy.
